{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00756","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献 · 李逢吉","name":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"既洁酒醴，聿陈熟腥。\n肃将震念，昭格储灵。\n展矣礼典，薰然德馨。\n愔愔管磬，亦具是听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}